Third-party data
================

The regulation and list snapshots in data/snapshots/ are parsed from the public
sources below and reformatted (converted to JSON, restructured and normalized).
They are reproduced for reference only. They are not official versions, they
may be incomplete or out of date, and the official publications of the issuing
authorities control. EyeWarnYou is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by
any government agency named here. Company and other entity names appear only as
they appear in these public lists, or in clearly fictional sample data; their
appearance implies nothing beyond the listing itself. Trademarks belong to
their respective owners.

1. United States - Export Administration Regulations (15 CFR Parts 730-774)
   Source: Electronic Code of Federal Regulations (eCFR), Office of the Federal
   Register (National Archives and Records Administration) and U.S. Government
   Publishing Office, https://www.ecfr.gov/ (eCFR Versioner API).
   Files: data/snapshots/ear-*.json.
   Works of the U.S. Government are not subject to copyright protection in the
   United States (17 U.S.C. 105). The eCFR is not an official legal edition of
   the CFR; the Code of Federal Regulations and the Federal Register control.

2. United States - Consolidated Screening List
   Source: International Trade Administration, U.S. Department of Commerce,
   Consolidated Screening List, https://www.trade.gov/consolidated-screening-list
   Not included in this repository; downloaded at run time into data/cache/.
   A potential match must be verified against the official publication of the
   list concerned (BIS, OFAC or the Department of State).

3. Japan - statutes, cabinet orders and ministerial ordinances
   (外国為替及び外国貿易法, 外国為替令, 輸出貿易管理令, 貨物等省令, おそれ省令)
   出典：e-Gov法令検索（デジタル庁）（https://laws.e-gov.go.jp/）
   「e-Gov法令検索」（デジタル庁）（https://laws.e-gov.go.jp/）の法令API（Version 2）により
   取得した法令データをもとに Tatsuya Sugiyama が加工して作成
   Files: data/snapshots/jp-library.json, jp-list-control.json, jp-countries.json,
   jp-derived.json.
   Laws, cabinet orders and ministerial ordinances are not subject to copyright
   under Article 13 of the Copyright Act of Japan (著作権法第13条). Other e-Gov
   content is provided under the Public Data License 1.0 (公共データ利用規約
   （第1.0版）, PDL1.0), https://www.digital.go.jp/resources/open_data/public_data_license_v1.0
   The text promulgated in the Official Gazette (官報) controls.

4. Japan - METI End User List (外国ユーザーリスト)
   出典：「外国ユーザーリスト」（経済産業省）（https://www.meti.go.jp/policy/anpo/20250929_4.xlsx）、
   PDL1.0（https://www.digital.go.jp/resources/open_data/public_data_license_v1.0）（2026年9月29日に利用）
   「外国ユーザーリスト」（経済産業省）（https://www.meti.go.jp/policy/anpo/20250929_4.xlsx）を
   もとに Tatsuya Sugiyama が加工して作成（Excel から JSON への変換、懸念区分コードの正規化）
   Files: data/snapshots/jp-end-user-list.json.
   Terms of use: https://www.meti.go.jp/main/rules.html (PDL1.0, compatible with
   CC BY 4.0). This processed version is not published by METI and must not be
   presented as if it were created or verified by METI.

5. China - MOFCOM designations (出口管制管控名单, 关注名单, 不可靠实体清单, 反制措施)
   来源：中华人民共和国商务部网站（https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/ ,
   https://aqygzj.mofcom.gov.cn/）。各公告的网址见 src/ingest/mofcom.ts 及
   data/snapshots/cn-lists.json 中每一条目的 sourceUrl。
   Files: data/snapshots/cn-lists.json.
   Official announcements of state organs and their official translations are
   excluded from copyright protection under Article 5 of the Copyright Law of the
   People's Republic of China. Entity names were extracted and restructured by
   EyeWarnYou; English names are as printed in the announcements. The
   Chinese-language announcements published by MOFCOM control.

